#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:4 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:77
msgid "Light Graffiti"
msgstr "Svjetli Grafiti"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:7 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:80
msgid ""
"Light Graffiti effect.\n"
"        <full><![CDATA[This effect allows to do Light Painting (i.e. "
"painting with light sources on a photo by keeping the shutter\n"
"        opened for a while), but for video.]]></full>"
msgstr ""
"Efekt Svijetlih Grafita.\n"
"        <full><![CDATA[Ovaj efekat omogućava da radite Lagano Crtanje "
"(crtanje sa svijetlim izvorima na slici zadržavanjem blende\n"
"        otvorene neko vrijeme), ali za video.]]></full>"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:10 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:83
msgid "Brightness Threshold"
msgstr "Granica osvjetljenja"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:12 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:85
msgid ""
"<![CDATA[How bright (<code>R+G+B</code>) does a pixel need to be in order to "
"be recognized as a light source?<br/>\n"
"            Increasing this threshold requires brighter light sources (i.e. "
"more white or less color, respectively) but prevents some «false alarms» "
"where semi-bright parts, e.g. hands where colors can change quite a lot "
"compared to the background, are incorrectly recognized as light source.]]>"
msgstr ""

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:15 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:88
msgid "Difference Threshold"
msgstr "Granica razlike"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:17 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:90
msgid ""
"<![CDATA[How much does the strongest color channel of a pixel have to "
"change, compared to the background image (<code>max(dR, dG, dB)</code>), in "
"order to be recognized as light source? <br/>\n"
"            Increasing this threshold makes it harder for light sources to "
"be accepted on bright backgrounds, but decreases the danger of noise or "
"generally bright spots counting as light source.]]>"
msgstr ""

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:20 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:93
msgid "Difference Sum Threshold"
msgstr "Suma razlike osvjetljenja"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:22 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:95
msgid ""
"<![CDATA[How much does the sum of all color channels <em>relative to the "
"background image</em> (<code>dR + dG + dB</code>) have to change until a "
"pixel is recognized as a light source?<br/>\n"
"            Raising this value might, in some cases, avoid that some light "
"objects lit by the light source are added to the light mask.]]>"
msgstr ""

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:25 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:98
msgid "Sensitivity"
msgstr "Osjetljivost"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:27 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:100
msgid ""
"<![CDATA[Light sensitivity.<br/>\n"
"            For slowly moving light source try to use a lower sensitivity to "
"obtain a better exposure.]]>"
msgstr ""
"<![CDATA[Osjetljivost svjetlosti.<br/>\n"
"            Za polako krećući izvor svjetla pokušati će iskoristiti nižu "
"osjetljivost da  dobije bolju izloženost.]]>"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:30 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:103
msgid "Lower Overexposure"
msgstr "Niska preekspozicija"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:32 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:105
msgid ""
"<![CDATA[Lowers overexposure.<br/>\n"
"            The light mask does not get white immediately when the light "
"source is moving slowly or staying steady.]]>"
msgstr ""
"<![CDATA[Smanjuje preekspoziciju.<br/>\n"
"            Svjetlosna maska ​​ne postaje bijela odmah kada izvor svjetlosti "
"se kreće sporo ili stoji stabilan.]]>"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:35 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:108
msgid "Dimming"
msgstr "zatamnjenje"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:36 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:109
msgid ""
"Dims the light mask. Lights will leave a fainting trail if it is set to a "
"value > 0."
msgstr ""
"Zamagljava svjetlosnu masku. Svjetla će ostavljati nestajući trag ako je "
"podešeno na vrijednost > 0."

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:39 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:112
msgid "Background Weight"
msgstr "težina pozadine"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:40 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:113
msgid ""
"Strength of the (calculated) background image. Setting it to 100 paints the "
"light mask directly over the background, without the painting person in the "
"image if the video starts with a «clean» background image. (See the α "
"parameter.)"
msgstr ""
"Jačina (izračunate) pozadinske slike. Postavljanjem jačine na 100 boja "
"svjetlosti maske ​​direktno preko pozadine, bez bojenja osobe na slici, ako "
"video počinje sa «čistom» pozadinskom slikom. (Pogledajte alfa parametar.)"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:43 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:116
msgid "α"
msgstr "α"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:45 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:118
msgid ""
"<![CDATA[Determines how the effect tries to adapt to background changes. <br/"
">\n"
"            The Light Graffiti effect remembers the first frame of the clip "
"it is applied to, so the clip should <em>always</em> start with the painter "
"outside of the video. If the background constantly changes, e.g. on a "
"street, try to set α > 0 to calculate an average background image.]]>"
msgstr ""

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:48 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:121
#: effects/frei0r_saturat0r.xml:3 effects/frei0r_saturat0r.xml:7
msgid "Saturation"
msgstr "Zasićenje"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:49 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:122
msgid "Increases the saturation of lights."
msgstr "Uvećava zasićenje svjetla"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:52 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:125
msgid "Show brightness statistics"
msgstr "Pokaži statistiku osvjetljenosti"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:54 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:127
msgid ""
"<![CDATA[The stats switches allow easy and accurate adjustment of the "
"threshold parameters.<br/>\n"
"            Example: To adjust the brightness threshold, check this box and "
"adjust the threshold until the whole light source is highlighted. Repeat the "
"same with the other parameters. Only parts that are highlighted in <em>all</"
"em> thresholds will count as light source.]]>"
msgstr ""

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:57 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:130
msgid "Show background difference statistics"
msgstr "Pokaži statistiku pozadinske razlike"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:60 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:133
msgid "Show background difference sum statistics"
msgstr "Pokaži statistiku pozadinske zbirne razlike"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:64 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:137
msgid ""
"Makes the background transparent, allowing to apply a composite effect and "
"paint the light mask over a completely different video."
msgstr ""
"Čini pozadinu prozirnom, dopuštajući da se primjeni kompozitni efekt i farba "
"masku svjetla preko potpuno drugog videa."

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:67 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:140
msgid "Nonlinear dimming"
msgstr "Nelinearno zatamnjenje"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:68 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:141
msgid "If normal dimming does not look natural enough, try this one."
msgstr "Ako normalno zatamnjenje ne izgleda dovoljno prirodno, pokušajte ovo."

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:71 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:144
#: src/geometryval.cpp:94 src/tracksconfigdialog.cpp:82
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Resetuj"

#: effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:72 effects/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:145
msgid ""
"Resets the light mask and the background image. This is necessary e.g. if "
"you apply this effect to a clip in the timeline and then move the timeline "
"cursor from outside of the clip to the middle of it. The effect receives "
"this frame in the middle as first frame and uses it as background image. For "
"proper threshold adjusting move the timeline cursor to the beginning of the "
"clip, check the Reset box and uncheck it again."
msgstr ""
"Ponovno postavljanje maske svjetlosti i pozadinske slike. Ovo je neophodno "
"ako npr. postavljate ovaj efekat na isječak u vremeplovu i onda pomjerate "
"kursor vremeplova s vana isječka ka unutrašnjosti. Efekat prima ovaj kadar u "
"sredini kao prvi kadar i koristi ga kao pozadinsku sliku. Za ispravnost "
"podešavanja pomjerite kursor vremeplova na početak isječka, označite Reset "
"dugmić i ponovo uklonite oznaku."

